Rule 52 (start and stop cannot both be negative or positive if number of points is greater than two)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor, v_3 : int} |= if v_3 > 2 then ((max(v_1) < 0 ∧ max(v_2) < 0) ∨ (min(v_1) > 0 ∧ min(v_2) > 0)) = false
