>>
Rule 56 (If stop is zero, start must be non-zero)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= if (min(v_2) = 0 ∧ max(v_2) = 0) then (min(v_1) ≠ 0 ∨ max(v_1) ≠ 0)
